sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BankStaff as Blood Bank Staff (ORG_ADMIN / INVENTORY_STAFF)
    participant BankUI as Blood Bank Portal
    participant API as Express API (:4000)
    participant AdminSvc as AdminMatchingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant WSS as WebSocket Server
    actor SysAdmin as Platform System Admin
    participant AdminUI as System Admin Portal

    %% Step 1: Matching Trigger
    BankStaff->>BankUI: Views incoming request with Shortfall = N
    BankStaff->>BankUI: Clicks "Request Donor Matching"
    BankUI->>API: POST /api/v1/organisation/:orgId/requests/:reqId/request-matching
    API->>AdminSvc: requestDonorMatching(requestId, orgId, shortfall)
    AdminSvc->>DB: UPDATE blood_requests SET message.matchingRequest = { status: 'REQUESTED' }
    AdminSvc->>WSS: emit('blood_request.matching_requested')
    WSS-->>AdminUI: Pushes event to System Admin queue
    API-->>BankUI: HTTP 200 (Status: REQUESTED)

    %% Step 2: Admin Matching Run
    SysAdmin->>AdminUI: Reviews Matching Request Queue
    SysAdmin->>AdminUI: Clicks "Run Matching Algorithm"
    AdminUI->>API: POST /api/v1/admin/donor-matching/requests/:reqId/run
    API->>AdminSvc: executeMatchingRun(requestId, scope, adminId)
    AdminSvc->>DB: Query compatible donors with hard filters
    AdminSvc->>AdminSvc: Score and rank deterministically
    AdminSvc->>DB: UPDATE blood_requests SET message.matchingRequest = { status: 'CANDIDATES_FOUND' }
    AdminSvc->>DB: INSERT into audit_logs (ADMIN_MATCHING_RUN)
    AdminSvc->>WSS: emit('blood_request.matching_searched')
    WSS-->>BankUI: Status badge updates: "Candidates Under Admin Review"
    API-->>AdminUI: HTTP 200 (Ranked candidates with reason codes)

    %% Step 3: Admin Review & Candidate Release
    SysAdmin->>AdminUI: Checks candidate checkboxes & clicks "Release Candidates"
    AdminUI->>API: POST /api/v1/admin/donor-matching/requests/:reqId/release
    API->>AdminSvc: releaseCandidateList(requestId, selectedCandidateIds, adminId)
    AdminSvc->>DB: UPDATE blood_requests SET message.matchingRequest = { status: 'RELEASED' }
    AdminSvc->>DB: INSERT into audit_logs (ADMIN_CANDIDATE_RELEASE)
    AdminSvc->>WSS: emit('blood_request.matching_released')
    WSS-->>BankUI: Status badge updates: "Candidates Released (Ready for Outreach)"
    API-->>AdminUI: HTTP 200 (Release confirmed)

    %% Step 4: Bank Fetches Pool
    BankStaff->>BankUI: Clicks "Review Released Candidate Pool"
    BankUI->>API: GET /api/v1/organisation/:orgId/requests/:reqId/matching-candidates
    API->>AdminSvc: getReleasedCandidatesForBank(requestId, orgId)
    AdminSvc->>DB: SELECT donor_profiles WHERE id IN (releasedCandidateIds)
    AdminSvc-->>API: Masked candidates (disclosureAuthorized: false)
    API-->>BankUI: HTTP 200 (Display Candidate Pool Modal)

